  "dct_description_sm": [
    "These data were collected to calculate under-ice exchanges of heat, salt, momentum and dissolved oxygen.  Fluxes of dissolved oxygen are intended to be used as a proxy for net ecosystem exchange.  Fluxes of salt can be used to infer fluid exchange between sea ice and the underlying seawater.  Fluxes of heat can be used for sea ice energy balance studies."
